msgstr "Raspakuje sve osnovne WordPress fajlove u folder domena."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/install.html:253
msgid ""
"Creates the .htaccess file with rewrite rules, adds database credentials to "
"wp-config.php, and adds the mu-plugin for HTTPS behind Varnish."
msgstr ""
"Kreira .htaccess fajl sa rewrite pravilima, dodaje podatke za pristup bazi "
"podataka u wp-config.php i dodaje mu-plugin za HTTPS iza Varnish-a."

